<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;">    app</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">dev-ma-001-ma-base</span><span style="--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D;"> # 标签选择器（必须和 Pod 标签一致）</span></span>
